\"should reject more damages than insured items\");\n});\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784943745251},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to run tests to verify they're passing. Then I'll evaluate the code for refactoring opportunities.\n\nLooking at the current code:\n- `processScenario` takes a scenario and returns a quote\n- `buildQuoteFor` handles item list quotes\n- There's a hardcoded branch for exactly 3 runes giving base premium 60 G\n- `basePremiumFor` maps item types to base premiums\n\nThe recent green phase added the hardcoded 3 rune branch. This is clearly a minimal implementation that doesn't reveal intent well. The branch is hardcoded and will need to become more general as more tests are added (4 runes, 7 runes, mixed blocks, etc.).\n\nRefactoring opportunities:\n1. Naming: `buildQuoteFor` could be clearer, `basePremiumFor` is decent\n2. The hardcoded \"3 runes = 60\" branch doesn't reveal intent - it's actually \"block discount for components\"\n3. Duplication: The processing fee addition is duplicated in both branches\n\nI should extract a meaningful \"component block discount\" concept and remove duplication of processing fee.\n\nLet me first run tests.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.bash:2","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"pnpm test"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":1924,"output":250,"cacheRead":6144,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":232,"totalTokens":8318,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784943745252,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-4b70702f-6f63-42ee-949a-ff678136d03e","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.bash:2","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n> tdd-experiment-run@ test /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_01-35-59_claim-office-example-mapping_v6